              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyuma y’ivyo, Yesu ariko arava muri ico gisagara, abona umutozakori yitwa Lewi yicaye aho yatoreza ikori, amubwira ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.27"
