            "sid": "LUK 5:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko Abafarisayo n’abigisha b’ivyagezwe babaza abigishwa ba Yesu babidodombera bati: “Ni kuki mwicarana n’abatozakori n’abandi banyavyaha, mugasangira na bo?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
